-- =====================================================================
-- Voter Information System - FULL DATABASE WITH DEMO DATA (restore file)
--
-- Contains all 16 tables WITH sample data: 3 assemblies (Jaipur North / Lucknow West /
-- Kolkata Port), 2,060 fictional voters with Hindi / Urdu / Bengali names, 36 booths,
-- parties, an election with booth results, SMS / WhatsApp templates and 5 users.
--
-- RESTORE
--   phpMyAdmin : select your (empty) database > Import > choose this file > Go
--   command    : mysql -u USER -p DATABASE_NAME < voter_db_demo.sql
-- Existing tables with the same names are DROPPED and replaced.
--
-- Logins:  admin / admin@123   operator / operator@123   viewer / viewer@123
--          jaipur / jaipur@123 (assembly 45 only)   agent / agent@1234 (assembly 52 only)
-- Change these passwords (or delete the demo users) before going live.
--
-- For an EMPTY database (your real data) import db/schema.sql instead.
-- Works with MySQL 5.7 / 8.x and MariaDB 10.3+. Character set utf8mb4.
-- =====================================================================


